      "seed": 976570431,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 1528634833,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786111949605,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. We need to start container so that it can make \nbeans/ objects \n\n2. for that we need to make Container object .\n\n3. There are two container \n\n4. BeanFactory and Application Context\n\n5. both are interface so make object of there child class\n\n6. most popular child of BeanFactory is XmlBeanFactory class.\n\n7. XmlBeanfactory constructor is parametrized takes\nResource type object reference .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. We need to start container so that it can make \nbeans/ objects \n\n2. for that we need to make Container object .\n\n3. There are two container \n\n4. BeanFactory and Application Context\n\n5. both are interface so make object of there child class\n\n6. most popular child of BeanFactory is XmlBeanFactory class.\n\n7. XmlBeanfactory constructor is parametrized takes\nResource type object reference .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zw1VWCNZG8N8BCgPVaEHq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 372,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 179,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
